// with an independent oracle (bench/oracles/qplan_cover.py). While the test lived here, nothing
// ran it, qplan_cost and qplan_plan_query had no caller (arch_check dead-function), and the
// coverage file still called the pre-a8afebde API (qplan_join_order, qplan_group_strategy).
// The unused `itoa` this file carried (a copy of tb.bp's, called by nothing in the planner) is
// gone too: its `let .. in while` form is the one construct tools/bpref.py cannot parse, so it
// aborted the whole typecheck census (invariants rung vii) at this file.
